      "layout": "P",
      "strengths": "The first viewport shows names, complete formulas and complete CAS numbers together. Storage instructions are relatively easy to read, headers stay on one line, and the full table has only two measured word breaks.",
      "faults": "The longest name wraps, including within the chemical name. Purity and storage are entirely beyond the initial viewport, and the table requires substantial horizontal scrolling. The long storage column also produces large empty areas in the shorter fields.",
