      "spatial_logic": "It spreads the limited width across all five columns and reserves the largest share for storage, but none of the text-heavy columns receives enough room for comfortable reading."
    },
    {
      "layout": "T",
      "strengths": "All names, including the longest, fit on one line in the full render; formulas and CAS numbers also fit intact. It has the smallest horizontal span among the scrolling layouts and only four measured word breaks.",
