      "spatial_logic": "It prioritizes complete names and formulas, paying for the wider name column by narrowing storage and accepting a partially visible CAS column at first sight."
    },
    {
      "layout": "U",
      "strengths": "All five columns are visible without horizontal scrolling. The formula column is wider than in S, reducing measured word breaks from 45 to 42 and keeping some short formulas whole.",
